{"id":108877961231008,"name":"[🏁] +1 Speed to ESCAPE","desc":"⚡ +1 Speed To Escape\n\nDash into the electric world of +1 Speed To Escape – a fast-paced speed-racing adventure where every step pushes you beyond your limits!\n\n👟 Gain speed with every single step you take!\n🏆 Beat challenging obstacle courses and prove your agility!\n💪 Train on powerful treadmills or sprint across wide maps to skyrocket your stats!\n⚡ Unlock insane multipliers and dominate the arena as the fastest player alive!\n\n😎 Join the group for update announcements, rewards, and to hang out with other speedsters!\n❤️ Love the game? Show your support by smashing LIKE and adding it to your FAVORITES!","path":"/game/108877961231008-1-speed-to-escape","slug":"108877961231008-1-speed-to-escape","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/148935d0b345a3ab81833b40a9348d487ed80928a373db7d0afc2e5b25efc134.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6ffcd236de64f6c86d93ea52d99c53f0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":21130536,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-10T20:47:17.162Z","creator":{"name":"Scratch Labs","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6962bad589eac87a14c1d097","title":"FREE SCRIPT NO KEY AUTO FARM CUPS","game":{"_id":"695231d38cf31e083b2f92a5","gameId":108877961231008,"name":"[🏁] +1 Speed to ESCAPE","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/148935d0b345a3ab81833b40a9348d487ed80928a373db7d0afc2e5b25efc134.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6ffcd236de64f6c86d93ea52d99c53f0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"108877961231008-1-speed-to-escape","path":"/game/108877961231008-1-speed-to-escape","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/148935d0b345a3ab81833b40a9348d487ed80928a373db7d0afc2e5b25efc134.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6ffcd236de64f6c86d93ea52d99c53f0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":108877961231008},"slug":"+1-Speed-to-E